# Dependencies
# Note: FONTS/lib/flatlaf-3.4.1.jar is deliberately NOT ignored.
# The Swing application relies on this JAR to run locally, and since the project
# uses a standard Makefile (without a dependency manager like Maven for the Swing part),
# the JAR must be committed so anyone cloning the repo can compile it out-of-the-box.
!FONTS/lib/flatlaf-3.4.1.jar

